<workout_file>
    <author>Coach Library</author>
    <name>Endurance 90 L05B - Z2 3x22 @ 70%</name>
    <description>Endurance 90 minutes - level 5 of 10, variant B. Z2 3x22 @ 70%.

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 22 min @ 70%, 4:30 @ 58%, 22 min @ 70%, 4:30 @ 58%, 22 min @ 70%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: Three structured Zone 2 blocks. Hold the power line flat on the third one. Eat 40-60 g of carbohydrate per hour on rides this long.

Estimated TSS: 66.</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
    <tags>
        <tag name="Endurance"/>
        <tag name="90 min"/>
        <tag name="Level 5"/>
    </tags>
